What this licence covers

The licence above covers the changes made by Olly Stedall and DigiNode Tools.
The rest of the code keeps its own terms:

- Files with a "Satoshi Nakamoto" or "The Bitcoin developers" copyright line
  (compat.h, netbase.*, protocol.*, serialize.h, uint256.h) come from Bitcoin
  and are under the MIT licence, as Bitcoin's own code is.
- strlcpy.h is copyright Todd C. Miller, under the ISC licence given in the
  file.
- The crawler, database and DNS server (main.cpp, db.*, dns.*, bitcoin.*,
  util.*) come from Pieter Wuille's bitcoin-seeder
  (https://github.com/sipa/bitcoin-seeder), with changes by the DigiByte
  developers. That project doesn't state a licence; its copyright stays with
  its authors.
